WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.063
Tom and Cat followed the footprints and hoofprints.

2
00:00:07.064 --> 00:00:20.054
The prints went deep into the Dark Forest.

3
00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:23.693
"It's spooky here," Tom said.

4
00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:26.197
"Where is the unicorn?"

5
00:00:26.198 --> 00:00:32.325
"Shh," Cat said. "I hear voices."

6
00:00:32.326 --> 00:00:34.443
Tom listened.

7
00:00:34.444 --> 00:00:37.874
"I'm having fun," Princess Mary said.

8
00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:41.284
"Me too," another voice said.

9
00:00:41.285 --> 00:00:44.509
"It's nice to have a friend."

10
00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.813
"That's the unicorn!" Cat whispered.

11
00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:52.882
Tom and Cat hurried into a clearing.

12
00:00:52.883 --> 00:00:57.755
Princess Mary was talking to a white unicorn.

13
00:00:57.756 --> 00:01:02.539
"What are you doing here, Tom?" Princess Mary asked.

14
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.340
"No one invited you!" the unicorn said.

15
00:01:07.341 --> 00:01:11.292
"Everyone is worried about you, Princess," Tom said.

16
00:01:11.293 --> 00:01:13.843
"You must come back to the castle."

17
00:01:13.844 --> 00:01:17.280
"I went for a walk," Princess Mary said.

18
00:01:17.281 --> 00:01:20.332
"And I met this unicorn."

19
00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:25.096
"You can't go back to the castle!" the unicorn said.

20
00:01:25.097 --> 00:01:31.237
"I am very lonely.

21
00:01:31.238 --> 00:01:34.506
An ugly ogre lives nearby.

22
00:01:34.507 --> 00:01:37.361
But he only wants to fight."

23
00:01:37.362 --> 00:01:39.647
Tom gulped.

24
00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:43.707
"Ogre?" he thought.

25
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:47.183
Princess Mary looked at the unicorn.

26
00:01:47.184 --> 00:01:50.801
"I'll tell everyone I'm safe," she said.

27
00:01:50.802 --> 00:01:53.658
"Then I'll come back to visit you."

28
00:01:53.659 --> 00:01:56.781
The unicorn stamped her hoof.

29
00:01:56.782 --> 00:02:00.890
"You will forget about me," she said.

30
00:02:00.891 --> 00:02:05.599
"I won't let you go!"

31
00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.422
"You can't keep the princess here!" Tom cried.

32
00:02:09.423 --> 00:02:12.944
The unicorn snorted.

33
00:02:12.945 --> 00:02:18.846
"Try to stop me!"

